    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. On the pricing side, how do I handle things if a supplier tries to act in bad faith or hides extra costs in the fine print? I want to make sure we aren't getting blindsided by some sneaky underhanded tactics or hidden threats in the contract that might mess with our margins later on.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
