      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To combat bad faith, include a robust \"Good Faith and Fair Dealing\" clause obligating both parties to negotiate honestly. Specifically demand detailed breakdowns for any cost adjustments, requiring the supplier to provide verifiable documentation for increased material or labor costs. Furthermore, define all payment terms and scope creep clearly in the Statement of Work (SOW) annexes to prevent unauthorized hidden fees.",
